abstract: >-
  Original finite-mode optimization and verification software, author-generated
  numerical records, original frozen checkpoints, endpoint profiles, and
  figure/table reproduction utilities accompanying the
  manuscript. Original software is MIT licensed; author-generated data,
  trained weights and graphics use CC BY 4.0.
